solution via 60-digit Gauss–Chebyshev quadrature, rounded to dyadics with
denominator 2^120; DF = exact folded-convolution Jacobian of the rounded
candidate (exact ℚ); A = exact ℚ inverse of DF rounded to denominator 2^90.
All bound values below were verified in exact rational arithmetic offline
and are re-certified in Lean by the Certificate file.
